# Vulnerabilities the image scan is told to ignore. Empty by default: a fixable
# HIGH or CRITICAL finding blocks publishing.
#
# To accept one, add its ID on its own line with a comment saying why it does not
# apply and when to look at it again, for example:
#
#   # CVE-2099-12345: affects a feature Mukurtu does not use. Review 2027-01-01.
#   CVE-2099-12345
